<title>USA: IFC delegation to visit Egypt.</title>
<headline>IFC delegation to visit Egypt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Finance Corp Executive Vice President Jannik Lindbaek will lead a delegation to Egypt this month to consult with government and industry leaders, the IFC said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The visit from May 15-23 will focus on the IFC's activities in Egypt, which have expanded in recent years in response to a more favorable environment for private sector development, the IFC said.</p>
<p>The IFC, part of the World Bank, has approved 49 investments in Egypt totalling $750 million to date, it said.</p>
<p>((-- Washington Newsroom (202) 898-8300))</p>
